{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have arrived at a research facility to rescue your younger sister. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to reach the 10th floor and save her.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you detect an anomaly, exit through the right door. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If no anomaly is detected, exit through the left door. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon reaching the 10th floor, a corridor will appear in front of you, leading to a room where your younger sister is located.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices and actions will determine the ending. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of three possible endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden items and interact with specific anomalies to uncover more.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Clear Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4035280/52cf37c97c3748ba979bd5ddfa42eff91017a767.jpg"},{"name":"Ending 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4035280/e7317c85aa3e4ba5ce9f99fb45d7b5dfbb40a5b1.jpg"},{"name":"Ending 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4035280/5e2a9e2b6fe697210c15d2bd5c99c71e272f1c1e.jpg"},{"name":"Ending 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4035280/4c68385d9244cbcb3cffbcee5ab5c91a89668073.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4035280?t=1762245081","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4035280?t=1762245081","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035280/b3b26cdd84fc8383b0ce4f6f8a00613e2156ef3f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762245081",